  "description": "Microsoft Fabric warehouse helpers for ClrKernel: from C# notebook cells, connect to a Fabric Warehouse SQL endpoint (Microsoft Entra auth), run T-SQL, and bulk-insert query results into warehouse tables by staging Parquet to OneLake and loading with OPENROWSET. Includes a reload-batch helper (delete a segment, reload it, run a batch of tables in parallel). Built on Microsoft.Fabric.Api, Azure.Storage.Files.DataLake, Parquet.Net, and Microsoft.Data.SqlClient.",
